tags: proof-of-work, pow

A kind of network: the nodes of one proof-of-work blockchain that are on one chain. A
member is a node of the chain, as it reports its own state. The node does not verify
the proof of work.

The value is key=value lines, sorted by key, separated by a newline. The required keys
are pow.chain (the name of the chain, for example ergo), pow.block_id (a block, in
lowercase hexadecimal) and pow.min_cumulative_difficulty (the work since the genesis
block, base 10). The optional keys are pow.min_height (base 10) and pow.max_tip_age_s
(seconds, base 10). Another key is not valid.

A member reports that its main chain contains pow.block_id, that its cumulative
difficulty is at least pow.min_cumulative_difficulty, that its height is at least
pow.min_height, and that its last block is not older than pow.max_tip_age_s. A node
that cannot resolve the chain refuses. The node is bound.

=== formal
check=what each node reports about its own chain; the proof of work is not verified
class=domain
members=the nodes of the chain pow.chain whose main chain contains the block pow.block_id, with a cumulative difficulty of at least pow.min_cumulative_difficulty, a height of at least pow.min_height and a last block not older than pow.max_tip_age_s seconds
name=proof-of-work
terms=a block is a group of data that holds the id of the block before it; a chain is a sequence of blocks from one first block (the genesis block); the height of a block is the number of blocks before it in its chain; the difficulty of a block is the number that the rules of the chain give to the work of that block; the cumulative difficulty of a chain is the sum of the difficulties of its blocks; the main chain of a node is the chain with the largest cumulative difficulty that the node knows; the last block is the last block of the main chain, and its age is the time since the time that it holds
value=key=value lines sorted by key: pow.chain (required: ergo, the chain of the ledger 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:003ec055b8a277e480cb04389b4a5c54eb7bf4e4596ce89959515d1707d98b7f, or bitcoin, the chain of the ledger 0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:42c3dae582a538b4e29e9c246d11a88dd1d4097995c66a2e9622517c163424ba), pow.block_id (required: the id of a block, in the digits 0 to 9 and the letters a to f, base 16), pow.min_cumulative_difficulty (required, base 10), pow.min_height (optional, base 10), pow.max_tip_age_s (optional, seconds, base 10); no other key
